    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "last_updated": "Last updated",
    "legal_framework": "Legal Framework & Definitions",
    "intro": "Ajiya Ta (\"we\", \"our\") is committed to protecting user privacy. This policy is established in accordance with **Law No. 2017-28 of May 3, 2017** on personal data protection in Niger and **ECOWAS Additional Act A/SA.1/01/10**.",
