    "technical_list": "• Device type and Android/iOS version\n• Error logs and performance metrics",
    "storage_security": "Data Storage and Security",
    "storage_desc": "In line with our \"Offline-First\" architecture, financial data is stored locally on your device.",
    "encryption": "For Cloud sync, data is encrypted in transit and at rest according to industry security standards.",
    "biometric_note": "Biometric data (fingerprint, face) remains strictly on your device's secure system and is never accessed by Ajiya Ta.",
    "your_rights": "Your Rights",
    "rights_intro": "In accordance with Niger and ECOWAS regulations, you have the following rights:",
    "rights_list": "• **Right of access:** View all data concerning you.\n• **Right to rectification:** Correct or update inaccurate data.\n• **Right to erasure:** Request permanent deletion of data.\n• **Right to object:** Object to data processing for legitimate reasons.",
