    "regulatory_authority": "Supervisory Authority",
    "regulatory_desc": "In case of an unresolved dispute, you may contact the **Haute Autorité de Protection des Données à caractère Personnel (HAPDP)** of Niger.",
    "contact_desc": "For questions regarding this policy:"
  },
